                                                "sense_id": "a1991a45-f061-3404-844b-5a269ecccbc5",
                                                "text": "Canon Bryan Rowe, quoted in the article. It's going to take months to put right. But you won't hear any twining [Cumbrian dialect for moaning]. Nobody is going: 'Woe is us'. Everybody is just trying to help somebody else."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
